--- !u!102 &292987633
TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 292987631}
  m_Text: 'FIRE PROCEDURE  -  FLOOR 4


    On the alarm, this floor is cleared

    by the nearest stair. Lifts do not

    run during an alarm.

    Assembly point: the front forecourt.


    Warden    G. Fenwick    ext. 214

    Deputy     O. Marsh       ext. 260


    The roll is called at the forecourt.

    Last drill: all present.'
  m_OffsetZ: 0
  m_CharacterSize: 0.012152777
  m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Anchor: 4
  m_Alignment: 1
  m_TabSize: 4
